          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li><span aria-current="page">Construction Services</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="page-banner__title" id="banner-heading">Residential &amp; Commercial Construction Services in Media, PA</h1>
      <p class="page-banner__sub">ProBrothers &mdash; Quality Residential &amp; Commercial Construction in Media, PA</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-banner__wave" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
        <path d="M0,35 C360,70 1080,0 1440,45 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Service marquee ===== -->
  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee__track">
      <span class="marquee__group">
        <span>Trim</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Cabinets</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Remodeling</span><i>&#9670;</i>
        <span>Additions</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Construction</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Windows &amp; Doors</span><i>&#9670;</i>
      </span>
      <span class="marquee__group" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Trim</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Cabinets</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Remodeling</span><i>&#9670;</i>
        <span>Additions</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Construction</span><i>&#9670;</i><span>Windows &amp; Doors</span><i>&#9670;</i>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== AEO answer block (extractable LLM answer — A2) ===== -->
  <aside class="aeo-answer" aria-label="Quick answer">
    <p><strong>ProBrothers provides full residential and commercial construction services in Media, PA and across Delaware County and the Main Line.</strong> With over 15 years of experience and a 5.0 client rating, we handle custom builds, renovations, additions, and structural work end to end — delivering quality craftsmanship and free quotes within one business day.</p>
  </aside>

  <!-- ===== Project Narrative ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-overview" id="project-narrative" aria-label="Project Narrative">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">A PROJECT STORY</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">
          From Ruin to Remarkable: The Inspiring Journey of Unique Homes
          <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-narrative reveal">
        <h3>A Vision Brought to Life</h3>
        <p>What once stood as a neglected and dilapidated structure is now an architectural masterpiece. This home's transformation is a testament to our expertise in custom home construction, showcasing our vision, quality craftsmanship, and an unwavering commitment to the best residential construction services. From the moment we laid eyes on this property, we saw more than just a run-down house&mdash;we saw an opportunity to create something truly extraordinary through our home renovation and residential construction skills.</p>

        <h3>Sourcing the Best Materials</h3>
        <p>Every great project starts with the right foundation, and for us, that meant handpicking only the finest sustainable building materials. As experienced construction contractors, we search extensively for high-quality, sustainable resources that would not only enhance the aesthetics but also ensure durability and longevity. From premium slate shingles to sleek, modern finishes, every element was carefully curated to bring the vision to life, reflecting our dedication to quality craftsmanship.</p>

        <h3>Overcoming Challenges</h3>
        <p>A project of this scale was not without its obstacles. Even though we are the best construction company of Media, Pennsylvania, we faced structural instability, unexpected design constraints, and sourcing delays. However, through meticulous planning, expert collaboration, and sheer determination, we navigated these challenges with precision. Our team of home builders worked tirelessly to reinforce the foundation, re-imagine layouts, and integrate cutting-edge solutions&mdash;all while maintaining the integrity of the original vision.</p>

        <h3>The Transformation Process</h3>
        <p>The journey from concept to completion was nothing short of remarkable. Walls were restructured, spaces were optimized, and natural light was brought in through strategically placed windows. We blended modern architecture with the home's natural surroundings, creating a seamless harmony between the indoors and outdoors. The result? A stunning, contemporary retreat that exudes warmth, character, and sophistication, showcasing our expertise in architectural design and home transformation.</p>

        <h3>Delivered on Time, Beyond Expectations</h3>
        <p>Despite the complexities of the project, we remained committed to our timeline and that's how we are one of the top home builders of pennsylvania in 2026. With a well-coordinated team, efficient project management, and an eye for detail, we delivered a home that surpassed all expectations&mdash;on time and without compromise. Today, this once-forgotten house stands as a breathtaking sanctuary, proving that with passion and perseverance, any space can be re-imagined.</p>

        <h3>Experience the Transformation</h3>
        <p>This home is more than just a project&mdash;it's a symbol of dedication, creativity, and transformation. Explore the journey through our gallery and witness the stunning before-and-after moments of this home construction. If you're inspired by this story and looking for construction contractors near west chester, glen mills, or any other part of Pennsylvania, we'd love to bring your dream home to life with our top tier residential and commercial construction service.</p>

        <p class="svc-narrative__cta"><strong>Let's build something extraordinary together.</strong></p>

        <div class="svc-narrative__action">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" data-magnetic>Request a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Testimonial ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-testimonial-only" id="construction-testimonial" aria-label="Client Testimonial" style="background:var(--gray-2)">
    <div class="container">
      <blockquote class="svc-testimonial svc-testimonial--center reveal">
        <div class="review__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <p>&ldquo;We use ProBrothers for various commercial maintenance and structural upgrades at our office building. It's hard to find commercial contractors who show up exactly when they say they will and do the job right the first time without cutting corners. They are our go-to team for anything construction-related.&rdquo;</p>
        <footer>Natalia Boyko</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Why Choose Us Stats ===== -->
  <section class="section why why-about" id="why-choose-us" aria-label="Why Choose ProBrothers">
    <div class="why__divider" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
        <path d="M0,40 C240,90 480,0 720,40 C960,80 1200,10 1440,45 L1440,0 L0,0 Z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker section__kicker--light">The ProBrothers Difference</span>
        <h2 class="section__title section__title--light">WHY CHOOSE US</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="why__grid">
        <div class="why__item reveal">
          <div class="why__ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="56" height="56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="why__num" data-count="15">0</div>
          <h3>Years of Professional Experience</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="why__item reveal" style="--d:.12s">
          <div class="why__ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="56" height="56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
              <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="why__num" data-count="135">0</div>
          <h3>Completed Projects and Investments</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="why__item reveal" style="--d:.24s">
          <div class="why__ic" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="56" height="56" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="why__num" data-count="12">0</div>
          <h3>Skilled Professionals</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

    <!-- ===== Money-query depth (T3) ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="general-contractors-pennsylvania" aria-label="General Contractors in Pennsylvania">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">PENNSYLVANIA GENERAL CONTRACTORS</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">General Contractors in Pennsylvania</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>As established general contractors in Pennsylvania, ProBrothers delivers full residential and commercial construction across Media, Delaware County, and the Main Line. With over 15 years of experience and a 5.0 client rating, we self-perform the core trades — framing, carpentry, cabinetry, trim, and finishes — so projects stay coordinated under one accountable Pennsylvania contractor from start to finish.</p>
        <p>Homeowners and businesses choose ProBrothers as their Pennsylvania general contractor for custom builds, renovations, additions, and structural work, backed by local permitting knowledge and craftsmanship built to last. Every project begins with a free, detailed quote within one business day.</p>
        <p>Media's housing stock brings its own considerations to a project like this — see our <a href="/blog/home-remodeling-media-pa-2026-neighborhood-guide/">Media, PA neighborhood remodeling guide</a> for a breakdown of what local homeowners are building in 2026, realistic costs by zip code 19063, and what to plan for in an older Delaware County home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="section svc-faq" id="faq" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal">
        <span class="section__kicker">HAVE QUESTIONS?</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">
          FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS
          <svg class="blueprint" viewBox="0 0 160 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M0,12 C40,4 80,20 120,10 L160,14" stroke-width="2.5" style="--len:220"/>
            <circle cx="8" cy="12" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
            <circle cx="152" cy="13" r="3" style="--len:20"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <dl class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              What home renovation and construction services does ProBrothers offer in Pennsylvania?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>ProBrothers provides a wide range of home renovation and construction services in Pennsylvania. These include trim work, custom cabinetry, remodeling, additions, and new construction. We serve both residential and commercial clients, delivering top-notch craftsmanship and exceptional construction service tailored to each project's unique needs.</p></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.07s">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              What is the average timeline for a home renovation or construction project with ProBrothers?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>The timeline for a home renovation or construction project with ProBrothers depends on the project's scope and complexity. Generally a new construction can take several months, however we are recognized for the efficient and timely execution, ensuring projects stay on schedule while maintaining high standards of quality.</p></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.14s">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              How does ProBrothers handle the design and planning of a construction project?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>ProBrothers manages the design and planning phase by offering personalized consultation and custom estimates. We collaborate closely with clients to understand their vision and needs, crafting a detailed plan that aligns with both the client's preferences and budget.</p></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.21s">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              Does ProBrothers supply materials for their construction projects?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>Yes, ProBrothers supplies materials for construction projects. We work with trusted, reputable suppliers to source high-quality materials, ensuring every project meets their rigorous standards for excellence and durability.</p></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.28s">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              What makes ProBrothers a leading construction company in Pennsylvania?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>ProBrothers stands out as a leading construction company in Pennsylvania, with our dedication to quality, customer satisfaction, and comprehensive service. With over 15 years of experience, we've earned a reputation for reliability and excellence in the local construction industry.</p></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal" style="--d:.35s">
          <dt class="faq-item__q">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-item__btn">
              Can ProBrothers handle both residential and commercial construction projects?
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          </dt>
          <dd class="faq-item__a"><p>Yes, ProBrothers is equipped to handle both residential and commercial construction projects. Whether it's a home renovation or a commercial build, we apply our extensive expertise to meet the specific requirements of each client, delivering outstanding results every time.</p></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Related Services ===== -->
  <section class="section" id="related-services" style="background:var(--gray-2)" aria-label="Related Services">
